  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.3 - DTLS client cipher-suite fix (via SpawnDev.SIPSorcery 10.0.8). The desktop DTLS client used to offer only the cipher suites matching ITS OWN certificate's signature algorithm, so it could not complete a handshake with any peer presenting the other certificate type - handshake_failure(40) AFTER ICE connected. It now offers both ECDSA and RSA authenticated suites. MEASURED against a live Reachy Mini robot: ECDSA peer 0 packets before, 990 after.",
